Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Tsuda, what's this I hear \Nabout you buying a sex robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.94,0:00:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Tsuda, tell me you're not that kind of criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can be together forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how cozily she's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, but robots don't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she broken?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's out of battery?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She {\i1}has{\i0} been turned on since she got here.{sgt: technically one would say "She has been on since", but the "turned on" double meaning seems too good to pass on.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, where's her power button?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Maybe on her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:00:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,On the front?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, I'm being a total pervert right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't leave her like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A QR code!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.07,0:01:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you for your purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.59,0:01:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}This video will guide you through \Nthe basics of your Nadeshiko sex android.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's start with booting her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do I even need to turn her back on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want to get rid of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but maybe I should leave her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, right, I forgot I ordered this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.81,0:01:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To activate the unit, give her a French kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then gently flip the switch inside her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is it? Where's the switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You wouldn't wake up, \Nso I was worried you were broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.23,0:02:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot about charging my battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I should've thought of it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Master? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}All I had that fit you was my \Nschool uniform, so I bought you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Although it has more \Nof a cosplay vibe than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.69,0:02:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks great on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're adorable, Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.60,0:02:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just say my name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You did! You've never done that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep calling me by my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh. Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.10,0:02:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}From now on, I'll enter sleep mode \Nwhen you do, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You can wake me up \Nin the same way you rebooted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The same way as rebooting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a functional limitation of master registration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you were registered, \Nall you would have to do is say my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.21,0:03:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So you can either register as my master, \Nor manually wake me up every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.50,0:03:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Which would you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither!
